{"recordId":"general_李孝恭","name":"李孝恭","type":"general","dynasty":"唐朝","title":"河間元王","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"李孝恭","pageId":348570,"revisionId":92073335,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-03-28T11:32:33Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E5%AD%9D%E6%81%AD","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92073335","wikidataId":"Q701713","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"全唐文补遗","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"唐故朝散大夫临晋县令上柱国李(鼎)府君墓志铭并序","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"唐故绵州昌明县令韦府君（嘉宾）墓志铭","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"旧唐书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新唐书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:01.593Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:xintangshu","source:songshi","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:xintangshu-6d311d871dced327","query":"李孝恭","count":1,"offset":1567,"excerpt":"諸鎮兵在寰內尚數萬，無所歸，畋招來之，厚加慰結。乃與涇原程宗楚、秦州仇公遇、鄜延李孝恭、夏州拓拔思恭約盟，傳檄天下。時王命不出劍門，四方謂王室微，不能復興；及畋檄至，遠近咸聳，各治兵思立功，奔問行在。巢大懼，不敢西謀。當此時，微畋，天子幾殆。帝聞","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-0b92ebdec33e70ed","query":"李孝恭","count":1,"offset":5664,"excerpt":"甫嵩、鄧艾、張飛、呂蒙、陸抗、杜預、陶侃、慕容恪、宇文憲、韋孝寬、楊素、賀若弼、李孝恭、蘇定方、王孝傑、王晙、李光弼，並西向；西廡，吳起、田單、趙奢、王翦、彭越、周亞夫、衛青、趙充國、寇恂、賈復、耿弇、段熲、張遼、關羽、周瑜、陸遜、羊祜、王濬、謝","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-316bbbd7defedd90","query":"李孝恭","count":2,"offset":10399,"excerpt":"長安，遂圍扶風。淵使李世民將兵擊之。又使姜謨、竇軌俱出散關，安撫隴右；左光祿大夫李孝恭招慰山南；府戶曹張道源招慰山東。孝恭，淵之從父兄子也。\n\n癸巳，世民擊薛仁果於扶風，大破之，追奔至□坻而還。薛舉大懼，問其群臣曰：「自古天子有降事乎？」黃門侍郎","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-c065d291b00430d5","query":"李孝恭","count":1,"offset":6988,"excerpt":"章事。升陝州爲節度使，以王重盈爲節度。又建延州爲保塞軍，以保大行軍司馬、延州刺史李孝恭爲節度使。克用時年二十八，於諸將最少，而破黃巢，復長安，功第一，兵勢最強，諸將皆畏之。克用一目微眇，時人謂之「獨眼龍」。\n\n詔以崔璆家貴身顯，爲黃巢相首尾三載，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:xintangshu-6d311d871dced327","bookId":"book:xintangshu","requestedTitle":"新唐書/卷185","title":"新唐書/卷185","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%94%90%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7185","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2020346","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%94%90%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7185?action=history","revisionId":2020346,"revisionTimestamp":"2021-03-12T17:10:48Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:54:02.404Z","sha256":"f35760ee6147f67333d24f5e19fbc444043a10e2674d5358cd73055f9b75dd33","textSha256":"1ceb748a3a34b2732cb305e26f9f086ec20d21d7e69a82b29af2ffd177c6c4b7","expandedWikitextSha256":"f35760ee6147f67333d24f5e19fbc444043a10e2674d5358cd73055f9b75dd33","characters":7024,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/xintangshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:40.088Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"